{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"やーい(¨)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いろいろやってて\nブログ遅くなりました(*_*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大阪終わりましたー！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"台風が日本に来てたりと\n天気が荒れたりしましたが\n大阪城ホールに来てくれて\n本当にありがとう！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大阪城ホール本当に大きくて\n楽しかった！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1公演目は\nおじいちゃんおばあちゃんおばさんいとこまま来てました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/08/27/4321917/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"3公演目では\nさゆりんのお誕生日祝いしました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"泣いてるさゆりんが\n不覚にも可愛いと思ってしまった！！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/08/27/4321917/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"改めてお誕生日おめでとう( ´ ▽ ` )ﾉ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"恒例の\n大阪グルメレポ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"豆狸 いなり寿司\n551豚まん、焼売"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"堂島ロール\nマダムシンコのマダムブリュレ\nあかんポテト\nデリチュースのチーズケーキ\n一心堂のフルーツ大福\n北極のアイスキャンディー\nみっくちゅじゅーちゅ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あと、京都になっちゃうけど\n辻利の抹茶チョコレートと抹茶大福"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"改めて量がやばい！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"25日のライブのあとは\nうどんすき\n26日のライブのあとは\nお好み焼き\n食べに行きました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/08/27/4321917/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"美味しかったー！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かりんまいまいがご飯会皆勤賞\nって話をライブ中にしてたけど\n実は中田は地方でどこもご飯行ってなくて\n大阪だけ皆勤賞してしまいました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大阪美味しいものありすぎ！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/08/27/4321917/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなみ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これにて地方公演は終わり。\nあとは神宮"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/08/27/4321917/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"頑張ります！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かな￣(=∵=)￣"}],"source":"archive"}